00:23:47.930 --> 00:24:03.020
<v Elaine Boehm>We've had to help people select items for their animals. And this woman and her husband came in. She was looking for a training collar, the pinch collar type. And, of course, they're pretty hideous looking, but they do do the job. And they don't hurt the animal, they just get the animal's attention.
<v Elaine Boehm>我们必须帮人们挑选动物用品。这天一对夫妇走了进来。她正在找项圈，那种刺突项圈。当然，它们看起来很恐怖，但确实有用。它们不会伤害动物，只是引起动物的注意。

00:24:03.020 --> 00:24:15.050
<v Elaine Boehm>Well, she couldn't make up her mind what size to get. So she looked over to her husband and she said, dear, come over here. And then she looked at me and she said, his neck is about the same size as the dog. Put this on, she says.
