00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:20.860
<v Elaine Boehm>And the guy stood there and took it as she puts the prong pinch collar around his neck. And she gives him a yank.
<v Elaine Boehm>那男的站在那，任由她把刺突项圈套在他脖子上。她猛地一拉。

